HELP.md

### Java ###
# Compiled classes and packaged archives
*.class
*.jar
*.war
*.nar
*.ear
*.zip
*.tar.gz
*.rar
# JVM crash logs and heap dumps
hs_err_pid*
replay_pid*
*.hprof
.attach_pid*
# Other Java tools
*.ctxt
.mtj.tmp/

### Maven ###
target/
!**/src/main/**/target/
!**/src/test/**/target/
pom.xml.tag
pom.xml.releaseBackup
pom.xml.versionsBackup
pom.xml.next
release.properties
dependency-reduced-pom.xml
buildNumber.properties
.mvn/timing.properties
.flattened-pom.xml
# The Maven wrapper jar must stay tracked. This line has to come after "*.jar".
!.mvn/wrapper/maven-wrapper.jar

### Gradle (in case the build ever moves to Gradle) ###
.gradle/
!gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar

